  - ThreadId: rhea-mending
    DisplayName: Perhaps I need a favour myself
    Summary: Rhea gives practical advice and foreshadows a future repair customer role.
    Priority: 20
    Stages:
    - StageId: mending-advice
      Title: Perhaps I need a favour myself
      Dialogue: "Rhea: Once that machine is set up, start with simple seams and keep the tension even. I have a coat that could use attention one of these days."
      RequireSocializingActivity: 0
      RequiredActivity: 0
      RequiredPlace:
      RequiredDiscoveryId:
      RequiredCompletedContractId:
      RequiredContract: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredUpgradeId:
      RequiredUpgrade: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ee000000000000000000000000000001, type: 2}
      RequireUpgradeNotAcquired: 0
      Choices:
      - ChoiceId: thank-rhea
        Label: "Thank her for the advice"
        Response: "Rhea: You're welcome. When you're ready, perhaps I'll bring that coat by."
